  "body": "Currently the standard says\r\n\r\n> Let buffer be the result of compressing chunk with cs's format.\r\n\r\nHowever, we also need to pass the current state into the compression algorithm. Probably we should create an empty _state_ in the constructor and then use it every time we compress a buffer.",
